node_modules/

# Sweep and soak output — results are regenerated, never committed.
# A committed CSV outlives its balance era and gets cited after it is void.
*.csv
reports/*.csv
# The gate runner writes one of these per day (M2): a timing log, not a document.
reports/gates-*.json
debugging/out/
# Smoke output is regenerated on every run; the probe images are not.
reports/smoke-*.png
# Per-view captures the compare sheet stitches. The sheet is the artefact; these
# are its working files, and three of them are 4 MB.
# Gate transcripts a review round writes, and the scratch captures a probe takes
# while somebody is looking at a bug. Seven logs and four PNGs reached `main`
# through one `git add -A` (M5). The artefacts a slice DELIVERS are not here.
reports/review*.log
reports/tmp/
reports/.photo-smoke.png
# `house_shots.mjs` opens a 320x240 page to ask where the houses are before it
# aims the real shots. The answer is the point; the picture is scratch (S9).
reports/.house-shots-probe.png
reports/.traffic-shots-probe.png
reports/.crowd-shots-probe.png
# `civic_shots.mjs` and the ad-hoc probes write these while aiming a shot. The
# answer is the point; the picture is scratch (S1).
reports/.civic-probe.png
reports/.probe.png
reports/.compare-*.png
reports/.sheet-*.png

# Build-step bakes: generated on the dev machine, never committed, guarded by a
# hash pin so a stale bake degrades gracefully instead of corrupting anything.
assets/baked/
client/assets/generated/

# Local saves and room state
saves/
rooms/

# Config with secrets; sanitized templates are committed instead
*.local.json
deploy/secrets/

.DS_Store

# local 
dev-prompts.md
dev-questions.md

